  "notes": "Whole surviving Birdsville Hotel/Q28035358/nativeway631682959 fourteen-control mainhotel and intrinsic attached bar/roof volumes. Single-storey rendered sandstone walls, corrugated hipped mainroofs, low parapet/raised corner tablet, truncated corner entrance, wraparound corrugated canopy/white timber posts/scalloped valance, dark staggered quoins/recessed sash windows/doors and low concrete verandah pad. Hidden rear roof divisions/current repairs/window census are original bounded estimates. Excludes detached motel units, open beer garden/yard/landscape, independent tanks/sheds, street/airport/aircraft and separate RoyalHotel ruin868510476; no interiors."
